// Win32 resources for vibeaudio.
//
// The icon is attached to the *executable*. That is what Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab read,
// and it is deliberately the only place an icon is declared: `window_chrome.cpp` loads it back out
// of the running executable and hands it to every window (design_doc.md sec. 5.6), so a second
// copy in a Qt resource would be a second thing to keep in step.
//
// Resource id 1 is not arbitrary at either end -- the shell shows the icon with the lowest id, so
// the application icon has to be the lowest one here, and `kApplicationIconId` in
// `src/window_chrome.h` is the number that has to agree with it.
//
// The path is relative to this file. `target_include_directories` on the target is what puts this
// directory on the resource compiler's search path; without it rc.exe resolves relative to the
// build directory and reports the file as missing.

1 ICON "assets/mixing-table-png.ico"
